{"type":"message","id":"9cd3a68b","parentId":"08f63184","timestamp":"2026-05-02T07:02:32.498Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"process_1777705252249_6","toolName":"process","content":[{"type":"text","text":"I am unable to complete the mission.\n\nMy required tool for reading article content, the Jina AI web proxy, is currently being blocked by content providers (Decrypt, Google News) due to suspected DDoS activity. This prevents me from extracting the necessary facts and raw content to generate the aggregated JSON summary.\n\nI followed all steps in my research workflow:\n1.  Fetched all four required RSS feeds.\n2.  Identified the \"Clarity Act\" as the primary news event. All associated URLs were invalid (404).\n3.  Identified \"Tether Q1 Profit\" as the secondary news event. Associated URLs were valid (200).\n4.  Attempted to read the articles for the \"Tether\" story using the mandatory Jina AI proxy.\n5.  The Jina AI proxy returned a `SecurityCompromiseError`, indicating it is temporarily blocked from accessing the requested domains.\n\nWithout the ability to read the source articles, I cannot fulfill the request.\n\nProcess exited with code 0."}],"details":{"status":"completed","sessionId":"wild-crustacean","exitCode":0,"aggregated":"I am unable to complete the mission.\n\nMy required tool for reading article content, the Jina AI web proxy, is currently being blocked by content providers (Decrypt, Google News) due to suspected DDoS activity. This prevents me from extracting the necessary facts and raw content to generate the aggregated JSON summary.\n\nI followed all steps in my research workflow:\n1.  Fetched all four required RSS feeds.\n2.  Identified the \"Clarity Act\" as the primary news event. All associated URLs were invalid (404).\n3.  Identified \"Tether Q1 Profit\" as the secondary news event. Associated URLs were valid (200).\n4.  Attempted to read the articles for the \"Tether\" story using the mandatory Jina AI proxy.\n5.  The Jina AI proxy returned a `SecurityCompromiseError`, indicating it is temporarily blocked from accessing the requested domains.\n\nWithout the ability to read the source articles, I cannot fulfill the request.\n","name":"rm ~/.openclaw/agents/res...sessions/sessions.json"},"isError":false,"timestamp":1777705352497}}
{"type":"message","id":"6d8e8172","parentId":"9cd3a68b","timestamp":"2026-05-02T07:02:43.696Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"**Analyzing Research Failure**\n\nIt seems the primary research agent encountered a roadblock. The Jina AI web proxy is being blocked, preventing it from accessing the necessary resources. I've consulted my `SOUL.md` and will pivot to alternative RSS feeds, specifically `decrypt.co/feed` and `coindesk.com/arc/outboundfeeds/rss/`, to ensure continued information gathering.\n\n\n**Identifying Extraction Bottleneck**\n\nThe researcher was able to fetch feeds, but the Jina AI proxy failed during the content extraction. My existing `SOUL.md` doesn't address this specific issue. Consequently, the pipeline stalled, and the `RESEARCH_JSON` was not produced, preventing further steps. I'll flag this and detail the error in the final report.\n\n\n**Detailing Downstream Block**\n\nThe researcher was able to fetch feeds and the extraction step hit a hard failure. The Jina AI web proxy is blocked; the researcher's article extraction tool failed, yielding a `SecurityCompromiseError`. My `SOUL.md` lacks a contingency for *this* specific issue. Without the `RESEARCH_JSON` from the researcher, I cannot progress. The user should be informed that the pipeline will not continue due to the blocked proxy.\n\n\n"},{"type":"text","text":"The crypto news pipeline has failed at the first step.\n\nThe researcher agent was unable to read the content of the news articles. Its web proxy tool is currently being blocked by the content providers.\n\nWithout the research data, the pipeline cannot continue. This may be a temporary issue, please try running the pipeline again later.","textSignature":""}],"api":"google-vertex","provider":"google-vertex","model":"gemini-2.5-pro","usage":{"input":937,"output":507,"cacheRead":8849,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":10293,"cost":{"input":0.0011712500000000002,"output":0.005070000000000001,"cacheRead