le ensuring a streamlined process for the command's arguments.\n\n\n**Converting and Executing**\n\nI'm now tasked with processing the JSON content, converting it into a single-line string. Subsequently, I'll leverage this condensed format for constructing the `exec` command. My primary objective is to maintain data integrity throughout this transition and ensure the command arguments are correctly structured.\n\n\n**Building the Command String**\n\nI'm now tasked with constructing the full command, incorporating the single-line JSON string. My focus now is ensuring the secure and correct integration of the JSON data within the larger command structure, to ensure accurate execution.\n\n\n"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"exec_1777706233146_35","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"\nresearch_json_content='{\"topic_theme\": \"CLARITY Act Stablecoin Regulation\", \"primary_keyword\": \"CLARITY Act crypto\", \"primary_headline\": \"CLARITY Act Stablecoin Yield Rules Finalized: ‘Go Time’ For Crypto Bill\", \"sources_used\": [\"CoinTelegraph\"], \"source_urls\": [\"https://cointelegraph.com/news/go-time-after-clarity-act-stablecoin-yield-compromise-finalized\"], \"combined_key_facts\": [\"The US CLARITY Act\\'s new stablecoin yield provisions have been finalized and published.\", \"The act prohibits paying interest for solely holding stablecoins but allows rewards for \\'bona fide activities\\'.\", \"Coinbase chief legal officer Faryar Shirzad stated, \\'It’s time to get CLARITY done.\\'\", \"Polymarket traders see a 55% chance of the CLARITY Act being signed into law in 2026.\", \"Galaxy Digital\\'s Alex Thorn expects the Senate Banking Committee to schedule a markup \\'imminently\\'.\"], \"aggregated_raw_content\": \"Title: CLARITY Act Stablecoin Yield Rules Finalized: ‘Go Time’ For Crypto Bill\\\\n\\\\nURL Source: https://cointelegraph.com/news/go-time-after-clarity-act-stablecoin-yield-compromise-finalized\\\\n\\\\nPublished Time: Sat, 02 May 2026 06:25:50 GMT\\\\n\\\\nMar